+[#2258]: https://github.com/RustCrypto/traits/pull/2258
+
+## 0.1.7 (2025-11-12)
+### Changed
+- Pin `generic-array` to v0.14.7 ([#2088])
+
+[#2088]: https://github.com/RustCrypto/traits/pull/2088
+
+## 0.1.6 (2022-07-16)
+### Added
+- Move `ParBlocks`/`ParBlocksSizeUser` from `cipher` crate ([#1052])
+
